+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+/* Reading a flight off the painting                                   */
+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+/* The promotion attaches a flight to a promoted meta, and the one thing it
+ * cannot take on trust is whether the painter drew one. `tools/flight-in-frame.mjs`
+ * is what asks the picture. Two things in it can be silently wrong and neither
